        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are authorized by the CBI under the European Communities (Electronic Money) Regulations 2011 for two of our entities in Ireland to act as e-money issuers and to provide payment services (including account information and payment initiation services to support our Rapid Transfer service) and have completed the necessary passporting notifications to operate in other EEA jurisdictions.",
        "start_character": 56860,
        "end_character": 57262
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we have the licenses and authorizations referred to above, our Digital Wallets segment issues e-money and provides payment services to customers in over 120 countries and territories, a majority in which we are not licensed as an e-money issuer.",
        "start_character": 63355,
        "end_character": 63609
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
