        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we believe demand is rising for globally scaled platforms that combine local market expertise with consistent service, support and risk management, enabling international growth without increasing operational burden.",
        "start_character": 25414,
        "end_character": 25643
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Building on the success of our eCash offering, we have also expanded relationships by cross‑selling digital wallet and merchant solutions, increasing the depth and continuity of these partnerships.",
        "start_character": 12321,
        "end_character": 12518
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Cross-Sell - we continue to focus on cross-selling the full breath of our product portfolio to drive growth within our existing client base.",
        "start_character": 33724,
        "end_character": 33864
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Data & Insights - we are leveraging the significant amount of data across our global ecosystem to (i) provide our business clients with valuable insights into consumer preferences and spending trends that help them grow their sales volumes and (ii) optimize our underwriting and onboarding capabilities to increase our acceptance rates and reduce the number of declined transactions due to false positive triggers;",
        "start_character": 35573,
        "end_character": 35987
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For smaller merchants, we use targeted marketing acquisition strategies tailored to specific use cases across verticals, geographies and customer profiles, complemented by a broad partner ecosystem of ISVs and independent sales organizations (ISOs) that embed or resell our solutions within their own offerings.",
        "start_character": 15205,
        "end_character": 15516
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, to the extent that our activities cause us to be deemed to be engaged in other business involving digital currency activities that are regulated in any state in which we operate, we may be required to seek a license or otherwise register with a state regulator and comply with state regulations.",
        "start_character": 60209,
        "end_character": 60517
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "ISVs—We work with approximately 210 ISVs who develop vertical-specific business management SaaS solutions for industries such as restaurants, spa/salon, gyms, charities, property managers, and field service companies, among others.",
        "start_character": 48040,
        "end_character": 48271
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-088095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-088095-dba228d6bafb2111",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-088095",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, laws prohibiting these activities and other laws, rules and or regulations, including the Telemarketing Sales Rule, which gives effect to the Telemarketing and Consumer Fraud and Abuse Prevention Act, and the Telephone Consumer Protection Act, may directly impact the activities of certain of our clients, and in some cases may subject us, as the client’s payment processor or provider of certain services, to investigations, fees, fines and disgorgement of funds if we are deemed to have aided and abetted or otherwise provided the means and instrumentalities to facilitate the illegal or improper activities of a client through our services.",
        "start_character": 73339,
        "end_character": 73995
      },
      {
